't remember the flow UI offhand, but I assume it's possible to cancel a pending dialog, is it not? Should there be a 7th bucket for this?"],["a3d427b2_1aade613",2,-8,0,"I don't want to act on this because we're already in some subset of Stable, but I wonder if this should have been a NOTREACHED(). Is it possible to accept a pending dialog?"],["bb001f1c_e428b7fa",17,-8,1,"nit: WDYT of naming this `SaveAndFillDialogResult` and making the other one `SaveAndFillDialogResultLegacy`? That way when it gets cleaned up it doesn't need to affect this one."],["ecacef84_b37e8aa9",18,-8,1,"ditto can avoid the `2` here and on line 51 and in the other file"],["c63de28c_529fc85e",11,-7,1,"nit: `Pending dialog (upload in progress) canceled` The \"upload in progress\" part to help imply this is impossible for a local use case, and rejected -> canceled because the user did initially accept…"]],0,123],[7264709,20439,2,0.089,0.062,[[2,19]],[],0,124],[7245759,20440,228,7.323,5.882,[[0,0.478,64,109],[1,0.449,47,105],[12,0.036,2,7],[13,0.036,0,7]],[["0350c382_1e5b3f8c",34,-5,1,"functions are out of order with .h file"],["12638e0f_9fd6da65",35,-5,1,"nit: Put `// SaveAndFillDialogView:` on the line above this to denote this as the section of overrides from SaveAndFillDialogView"],["1492aa28_ebeed6a9",6,-5,1,"Can fold this into the same check on the line above"],["16075f97_c2bb7beb",2,-5,1,"Should this be inside the new `if` statement just below?"],["4dd6b83b_3e95f6b9",14,-5,0,"THANK YOU for the screencasts! They make the importance of this CL super obvious to see, and easy to tell what's changing!"],["aa8e7a28_1b3a5098",35,-5,1,"Don't necessarily need this unless you think it provides new information. Overrides usually just rely on the documentation of their original function."],["d123bfaf_5ca52f46",2,-5,0,"What happens if it's not, or what situations should that occur in?"],["d25846df_d32bb92c",2,-5,1,"Is this CHECK no longer necessary?"],["2bb784c3_2b6276f7",3,-2,1,"Add backticks (`) around callback"],["948efda7_e2dedc3e",5,-2,0,"Timeouts won't hit this check, I hope?"],["964618d3_6aefb3dd",3,-2,0,"nit: With the new param added, please include what it is in the function description comment."],["ede69dba_d0e6415c",6,-1,0,"Is it safe to invoke this directly after `AddChildView()`? I think it is safer to call ``` GetWidget()->GetRootView()->Layout(); // Or InvalidateLayout() + LayoutImmediately() ``` before getting the…"]],0,125]]}